  title: Si vs Ge Gap
  summary: 'Smaller bandgap Eg makes thermal carrier generation exponentially easier: Ge (0.67 eV, ni=2.4e13) conducts far more than Si (1.12 eV, ni=1.5e10) at 300 K.'
